    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "SLAM! FLIP Fabrique and Ex Machina are causing quite a commotion in the wrestling world, each bringing their own expertise into the ring. With a decisive match between theatrical titans and circus players, Robert Lepage sets up the scene and script.  SLAM!  is theater and circus in the wrestling world. It’s where a kilted Scotsman […]"
      }
